 | {{field-1}} | $- \\\\frac{105}{4}$ | {{field-3}} | $- \\\\frac{1261}{12}$ |\\n| $y$ | $2$ | $\\\\frac{55}{12}$ | $\\\\frac{52}{3}$ | {{field-2}} | $\\\\frac{310}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{2299}{12}$ |\" :question/worked-solution \"- To find the value of $x(2),$ we substitute $t=2$ into $$\\n\\\\displaystyle x=- \\\\frac{3 t^{3}}{4} - \\\\frac{t^{2}}{3} - 3.\\n$$ This gives\\n\\n$$\\nx(2)=- \\\\frac{3 (2)^{3}}{4} - \\\\frac{(2)^{2}}{3} - 3=(-3)+(-6)+\\\\left(- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{31}{3}.\\n$$\\n\\n- To find the value of $y(3),$ we substitute $t=3$ into $$\\n\\\\displaystyle y=\\\\frac{5 t^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{4 t^{2}}{3} + 2.\\n$$ This gives\\n\\n$$\\ny(3)=\\\\frac{5 (3)^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{4 (3)^{2}}{3} + 2=(2)+(12)+\\\\left(\\\\frac{135}{4}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{191}{4}.\\n$$\\n\\n- To find the value of $x(4),$ we substitute $t=4$ into $$\\n\\\\displaystyle x=- \\\\frac{3 t^{3}}{4} - \\\\frac{t^{2}}{3} - 3.\\n$$ This gives\\n\\n$$\\nx(4)=- \\\\frac{3 (4)^{3}}{4} - \\\\frac{(4)^{2}}{3} - 3=(-3)+(-48)+\\\\left(- \\\\frac{16}{3}\\\\right)=- \\\\frac{169}{3}.\\n$$\\n\\nThen the table is\\n\\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| $x$ | $-3$ | $- \\\\frac{49}{12}$ | $- \\\\frac{31}{3}$ | $- \\\\frac{105}{4}$ | $- \\\\frac{169}{3}$ | $- \\\\frac{1261}{12}$ |\\n| $y$ | $2$ | $\\\\frac{55}{12}$ | $\\\\frac{52}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{191}{4}$ | $\\\\frac{310}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{2299}{12}$ |\"} {:db/id 17592186557670 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"b7cff924-1954-555d-b135-ab4d700b0ed9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{59}{4}\" :db/id 17592186557678}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"b7cff924-1954-555d-b135-ab4d700b0ed9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{59}{4}\" :db/id 17592186557678} :answer-field/id #uuid \"15bb14e9-78de-50b0-8b65-84693a6bcfcd\" :answer-field/key \"field-2\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :a