his gives\\n\\n$$\\nx(2)=\\\\frac{3 (2)^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{2 (2)^{2}}{3} + 4=(4)+\\\\left(\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\right)+(6)=\\\\frac{38}{3}.\\n$$\\n\\n- To find the value of $y(3),$ we substitute $t=3$ into $$\\n\\\\displaystyle y=\\\\frac{t^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{4 t^{2}}{3} - 4.\\n$$ This gives\\n\\n$$\\ny(3)=\\\\frac{(3)^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{4 (3)^{2}}{3} - 4=(-4)+\\\\left(\\\\frac{27}{4}\\\\right)+(12)=\\\\frac{59}{4}.\\n$$\\n\\n- To find the value of $x(4),$ we substitute $t=4$ into $$\\n\\\\displaystyle x=\\\\frac{3 t^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{2 t^{2}}{3} + 4.\\n$$ This gives\\n\\n$$\\nx(4)=\\\\frac{3 (4)^{3}}{4} + \\\\frac{2 (4)^{2}}{3} + 4=(4)+\\\\left(\\\\frac{32}{3}\\\\right)+(48)=\\\\frac{188}{3}.\\n$$\\n\\nThen the table is\\n\\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| $x$ | $4$ | $\\\\frac{65}{12}$ | $\\\\frac{38}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{121}{4}$ | $\\\\frac{188}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{1373}{12}$ |\\n| $y$ | $-4$ | $- \\\\frac{29}{12}$ | $\\\\frac{10}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{59}{4}$ | $\\\\frac{100}{3}$ | $\\\\frac{727}{12}$ |\"} {:db/id 17592186557674 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"0eeba19e-e3f1-5ae9-a105-c7e871a42454\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{69}{4}\" :db/id 17592186557628}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"0eeba19e-e3f1-5ae9-a105-c7e871a42454\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{69}{4}\" :db/id 17592186557628} :answer-field/id #uuid \"adce71b8-1f1b-5adb-9ff0-f11b5f943c0b\" :answer-field/key \"field-2\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 17592186557676} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"74f0b300-1b82-545f-983c-363069311507\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\" :db/id 17592186557660}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"74f0b300-1b82-545f-983c-363069311507\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{